 "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello Motsuni, I've been viewing your art and enjoy the vibrant energy in your work so I would like you to consider drawing my FF14 (Miqote ♀ Moonkeeper) character. \n\nI'd like the outfit to be similiar to what is shown in the reference, marks on the face to be included. I would like to use this as a profile picture but I also don't want to restrict your creativity in any way. \n\nThe background, pose and facial expression is up to you, she is shy but can also be cheerful.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1MPzfcbfhX01jnU2auAO03ZwLTzz7KWxa?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Doxxvz/works/199", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/845fdbe9/uploads/origins/df5b10cb-6e84-4d93-927f-a180eb343619?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fd29af2e44b8fb11c7963d209e47cdfe", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/845fdbe9/uploads/origins/df5b10cb-6e84-4d93-927f-a180eb343619?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fd29af2e44b8fb11c7963d209e47cdfe, https://si.imgix.net/845fdbe9/uploads/origins/df5b10cb-6e84-4d93-927f-a180eb343619?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9a976213d0c4572573b493a6bb71d119 2x, https://si.imgix.net/845fdbe9/uploads/origins/df5b10cb-6e84-4d93-927f-a180eb343619?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d8af01a72f0dc951a3e20c66c0a9218a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Twitterをスクロールしていたら、あなたの作品を見かけました。参考資料の衣装とポーズで私のキャラクターを描いてください。\n\n背景や構図はお任せします。デザインは自由に変更していただいて構いません。\n\nありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1XbjRpNwipKUcs8PYI2oDTpikaNjizjew", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Doxxvz/works/198", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/33d25803/uploads/origins/1cb89813-8118-4305-a0d9-84c45fa4a368?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6fc5e756edc21399a26a